{"version":1,"key":"card:469","content":{"id":469,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c99ed09-4bbf-41d9-8839-d2380e7c3258","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实现一个自定义序列，需要实现它们的基本行为（协议），不可变对象需要实现两个方法，而可变对象需要实现四个。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"cb2e3d31-e16b-4963-a394-be97ec1f4852","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f99f370d-f281-44c2-b902-20ac6619075c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3c23e966-1767-4ea8-87fe-946ef130e73e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__len__(self)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：这个方法应返回集合包含的项数，对序列来说为元素个数，对映射来说为键-值对数。如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__len__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回零（且没有实现覆盖这种行为的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__nonzero__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"），对象在布尔上下文中将被视为假（就像空的列表、元组、字符串和字典一样）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ccd75b5f-ac83-48f5-a782-d25fdd062fef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c3c1cbd0-60e6-498f-b203-cd84d20917c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getitem__(self, key)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：这个方法应返回与指定键相关联的值。对序列来说，键应该是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0~n-1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的整数（也可以是负数，这将在后面说明），其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"n"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为序列的长度。对映射来说，键可以是任何类型"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"eebdbac6-e031-4451-b5de-0206a0a0a22c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0bf270f0-b8d4-4203-892f-09071b9d85af","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__setitem__(self, key, value)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：这个方法应以与键相关联的方式存储值，以便以后能够使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__getitem__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来获取。当然，仅当对象可变时才需要实现这个方法"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3c13edd5-847b-4f12-aaa8-77b9498183e4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b76ce815-a623-45a6-b39c-fdadd4870657","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__delitem__(self, key)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：这个方法在对对象的组成部分使用"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__del__"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句时被调用，应删除与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"key"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相关联的值。同样，仅当对象可变（且允许其项被删除）时，才需要实现这个方法"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"530c400a-41dc-4efb-a703-372cda15649c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一些额外的要求："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a8ebeec7-5729-4bae-a54e-0334e2407a1b","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"858175ae-8f38-4e00-b783-d3afa758591b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"33f5e1a0-54d0-4ec4-a389-9b785940ce36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于序列，如果键为负整数，应从末尾往前数。换而言之，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x[-n]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 应与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x[len(x)-n]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等效"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d0688a14-92bb-4e82-86ba-fb6d7740b41a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"12ed1d48-8416-4fe3-89a1-0815a5b6968a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果键的类型不合适（如对序列使用字符串键），可能引发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"TypeError"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 异常"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2814c4f0-5990-4687-901f-fea2d6f1a512","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2d6dce40-4aff-4367-b3b4-25f1304b9c1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于序列，如果索引的类型是正确的，但不在允许的范围内，应引发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"IndexError"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 异常"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"580ad4bb-c035-4991-a001-fd79a14f8dac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子：无穷序列"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"34700d33-ad37-43b8-8390-e0e904d0b628","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9d3b7b23-cb8d-42f2-a41c-9b096a684806","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"def check_index(key):\n    \"\"\"\n    指定的键是否是可接受的索引？\n\n\n    键必须是非负整数，才是可接受的。如果不是整数，\n    将引发TypeError异常；如果是负数，将引发Index\n    Error异常（因为这个序列的长度是无穷的）\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(key, int): raise TypeError\n    if key < 0: raise IndexError\n\n\nclass ArithmeticSequence:\n\n\n    def __init__(self, start=0, step=1):\n      \"\"\"\n      初始化这个算术序列\n\n\n      start   -序列中的第一个值\n      step    -两个相邻值的差\n      changed -一个字典，包含用户修改后的值\n      \"\"\"\n      self.start = start                                # 存储起始值\n      self.step = step                                  # 存储步长值\n      self.changed = {}                                 # 没有任何元素被修改\n\n\n    def __getitem__(self, key):\n       \"\"\"\n       从算术序列中获取一个元素\n       \"\"\"\n       check_index(key)\n\n\n       try: return self.changed[key]                    # 修改过？\n       except KeyError:                                 # 如果没有修改过，\n          return self.start + key * self.step           # 就计算元素的值\n\n\n    def __setitem__(self, key, value):\n       \"\"\"\n       修改算术序列中的元素\n       \"\"\"\n\n\n       check_index(key)\n\n\n       self.changed[key] = value                       # 存储修改后的值","collabId":"a08d70f4-0a34-478e-9ed5-b526d86960e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"50b39aa5-63dc-4c08-bc90-6efd6e32ba77","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1c7ff196-0d8d-47ac-96eb-99305257861d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> s = ArithmeticSequence(1, 2)\n>>> s[4]\n9\n>>> s[4] = 2\n>>> s[4]\n2\n>>> s[5]\n11","collabId":"7d920122-75a4-40d8-8906-9b1e27df8106","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"575cebbb-12d9-46bc-aa54-fbd5fcd3b1ca","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f09ab3cd-d1eb-485a-bf47-b8f76504eb4c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> del s[4]\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in ?\nAttributeError: ArithmeticSequence instance has no attribute '__delitem__'","collabId":"6fb6c503-b84d-43df-955a-13d8dc135c6f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"24f5bf25-2655-46fd-ad3c-b92a00fdb583","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3cf86317-e031-4203-b90a-29125416a71a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> s[\"four\"]\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in ?\n  File \"arithseq.py\", line 31, in __getitem__\n    check_index(key)\n  File \"arithseq.py\", line 10, in checkIndex\n    if not isinstance(key, int): raise TypeError\nTypeError\n\n>>> s[-42]\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in ?\n  File \"arithseq.py\", line 31, in __getitem__\n    check_index(key)\n  File \"arithseq.py\", line 11, in checkIndex\n    if key < 0: raise IndexError\nIndexError","collabId":"f6c12bff-f63f-491b-8654-ac1712b87223","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2d205172-5f57-47aa-a7fb-a2ecbb6a01e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dict"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"str"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 派生，可以自动实现其他的一些魔法方法，比如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__iter__"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，省去了大量的工作量。"}]}],"tags":["Python/魔法方法"],"createTime":1719272782459,"updateTime":1791474923043,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923043}}